---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy policy" description="How enquiry information submitted through the Luxury Realty website is handled.">
 <section class="container legal-page"><p class="eyebrow">Your information</p><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="legal-intro">This notice describes information submitted through the Luxury Realty website.</p>
 <h2>Enquiries</h2><p>When you send an enquiry, we collect the name, email address, optional telephone number and message you provide, together with the project or property you selected, your consent and the time of submission. This information is used to review and respond to your request.</p>
 <h2>Storage and access</h2><p>Enquiries are stored in private storage hosted by Vercel for the site operator. Form contents are not published on the website. The site does not claim that an email has been sent when your enquiry is saved. Access to stored submissions is controlled through the operator’s hosting account.</p>
 <h2>Technical information</h2><p>The hosting service processes technical request information needed to deliver and protect the website. The enquiry endpoint validates submissions and uses limited anti-abuse checks. The website does not add advertising trackers or analytics cookies.</p>
 <h2>Your choices</h2><p>Only provide information relevant to your property enquiry. You can request access, correction or deletion of an enquiry by contacting <a href={'mailto:'+site.email}>{site.email}</a>. Include enough detail to identify your request.</p>
 <h2>External services</h2><p>Links to maps and individual project sites open external services with their own privacy practices. Those services receive information when you choose to visit them.</p>
 <h2>Contact</h2><p>Luxury Realty Real Estate LLC<br/>{site.address}<br/><a href={'mailto:'+site.email}>{site.email}</a><br/><a href={'tel:'+site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></p>
 </section>
</Layout>
